From: Canopy <demo@canopy>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] webui: add Canopy demo UI mode + Settings toggle

Wire the Canopy demo UI mode into the app:

 * store/api.js  - install a mock axios adapter that answers from hardcoded
   Redfish data (src/env/demo) when demo mode is enabled.
 * main.js       - seed an authenticated session before mount so the
   dashboard is shown with no BMC and no login.
 * router/routes.js + AppNavigation - add a Settings > Demo mode page that
   toggles demo mode (persisted in localStorage) and reloads the UI.

The demo sources live in src/env/demo and src/views/Settings/DemoMode.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [Canopy demo-only feature]
---
diff --git a/src/components/AppNavigation/AppNavigationMixin.js b/src/components/AppNavigation/AppNavigationMixin.js
index dc9e050..01f9b47 100644
